{"parentUuid": "b7147195-d4b6-4810-9413-75e58781572e", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/ubuntu/smasurekar/hermes-agent-smasurekar/hermes-runs/20260907-191629__dsqa90__forced-skill/queries/deepsearchqa-0364/trace", "sessionId": "20260907_205200_54c4c3", "version": "hermes-agent", "gitBranch": "", "uuid": "308d2648-a32c-4f09-8e8e-4cfd48f0133c", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T20:57:59.999Z", "type": "assistant", "message": {"role": "assistant", "model": "nvidia/nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": ""}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "chatcmpl-tool-67e353f5e86a46a6a9f8956994c08604", "name": "write_file", "input": {"path": "/home/ubuntu/smasurekar/hermes-agent-smasurekar/hermes-runs/20260907-191629__dsqa90__forced-skill/queries/deepsearchqa-0364/.hermes/research/deepsearchqa-0364/plan.md", "content": "# Research Plan: Autism Intervention Age vs Poverty Rate by State (2023)\n\n## Goal\nRank the 10 states with the oldest average age of first autism intervention (per 2023 Autism Speaks data) by their 2023 poverty rate (per Census.gov), highest to lowest.\n\n## Components\n1. **Identify the 10 states** with oldest average age of first autism intervention from 2023 Autism Speaks data\n2. **Find 2023 poverty rates** (% population below poverty line) for those 10 states from Census.gov\n3. **Rank the 10 states** by poverty rate descending\n\n## Constraints\n- Must use 2023 data from both sources\n- Autism Speaks data must be authoritative (official report/website)\n- Census.gov data must be from official Census Bureau (ACS 2023 or similar)\n- Output: ranked list of 10 states with both metrics\n\n## Queries\n\n### Query 1 (High depth): Autism Speaks 2023 state-level autism intervention age data\nFind the 2023 Autism Speaks report/data showing average age of first autism intervention by state, specifically identifying the 10 states with the oldest average ages.\n\n### Query 2 (High depth): Census.gov 2023 poverty rates by state\nFind 2023 poverty rate (% below poverty line) for all 50 states from Census.gov (American Community Survey 2023 1-year estimates or similar).\n\n### Query 3 (Medium depth): Cross-reference and rank\nMatch the 10 states from Query 1 with their poverty rates from Query 2 and produce final ranking."}}]}}
